WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Take turns rolling five dice, up to three times;
13 rounds fill 13 boxes. The higher total wins.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000 line:0
Tap Roll: the first roll throws all five dice,
showing three 6s.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000 line:0
Tap the three 6s to keep them
and roll the other two.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:0
Another 6: four 6s now.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000 line:0
You may score after any roll: Sixes counts
only the 6s, so four of them make 24.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.000 line:0
East rolls 1 to 5 at once
and scores 40 as a Large Straight.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:54.999 line:0
Fast-forward through the other 12 rounds;
each box is used once, a 0 if it cannot be met.

00:00:54.999 --> 00:01:04.000 line:0
North’s upper boxes reach 63 for a 35 bonus;
North wins 267 to 168.
